From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ethan Hill <ethan.hill1999@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 10:59:35 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] KitKat UI P13 followup: drop orphaned OLED theme
 resources

The KitKat UI P13 patch reassigned keyboardTheme/themeId enum value 7
from OLED to KitKat and removed THEME_ID_OLED from KeyboardTheme, but
left the OLED style/color/icon/drawable resources behind, so aapt2
link failed with:

  res/values/themes-oled.xml:25: error: expected enum but got (raw string) OLED.

Delete the orphaned OLED resource set and fold the keyboardTheme case
flag "ICS|KLP|You|OLED" (OLED used the ICS geometry) into
"ICS|KLP|You|KitKat".

Change-Id: I64d2d186488ac5190d102b1b2c778bd44ce15c3e
